[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":111},["ShallowReactive",2],{"news-detail-university-of-alberta-masters-scholarship-2026-fully-funded-opportunity-148":3},{"news":4,"more":28},{"id":5,"slug":6,"title":7,"content":8,"authorName":9,"authorId":10,"status":11,"recommended":12,"datePosted":13,"deadline":14,"images":15,"notifiedAt":14,"notifiedBy":14,"createdAt":13,"updatedAt":21,"categories":22,"readTime":27},148,"university-of-alberta-masters-scholarship-2026-fully-funded-opportunity-148","University Of Alberta Masters Scholarship 2026 | Fully Funded Opportunity","\u003Cp>University of Alberta Masters Scholarship: How about a fully funded Masters Scholarship in Canada? \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The University of Alberta is currently recryuiting eligible students for its Masters opening to study at the Canadian-based university.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The University of Alberta Masters Scholarship guarantee minimum of $26,400\u002Fyear for 2 years to help cover the tuition fees. Graduate students at the U of A also have access to benefits including a health and dental plan.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>University of Alberta Masters Scholarship Abstract\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Host: University of Alberta\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Study Abroad: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fcategory\u002Fscholarships-and-opportunities\u002Fstudy-abroad\u002Fstudy-in-canada\u002F\">Study-In-Canada\u003C\u002Fa> \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Location: Canada\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Category: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fcategory\u002Fscholarships-and-opportunities\u002Fpostgraduate-scholarships\u002F\">Postgraduate Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fcategory\u002Fscholarships-and-opportunities\u002Fmasters-scholarships\u002F\">Masters Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Benefits: \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Tuition\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>$26,400 Stipends\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Eligibility: All Countries\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Deadline: Not Specified\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>University of Alberta Masters Scholarship Details\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The University of Alberta Masters Scholarship seeks to welcome a new graduate student to the Master of Science in Water Resources Engineering program at the University of Alberta.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The selected student will join a collaborative research group from the Department of Civil Engineering who are focused on studying river ice processes.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The Water Resources Engineering group at the U of A is a very knowledgeable, supportive, and collaborative group. Students learn from experts in a variety of fields (e.g., river ice, fluid mechanics, water management) and have the opportunity to present their own research at local, national, and international conferences.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>University of Alberta Masters Scholarship Benefits\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>For an international student, the research group will guarantee minimum of $26,400\u002Fyear for 2 years to help cover the increased tuition paid by international students.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Students are also eligible for scholarships and awards and can earn extra money by optionally working as a Teaching Assistant.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Graduate students at the U of A also have access to benefits including a health and dental plan, subsidised access to local transit systems, and support for graduate students who are parents.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>University of Alberta Masters Scholarship Requirements\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To be eligible for theUniversity of Alberta Masters Scholarship, applicants must satisfy the following conditions:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Hold an undergraduate degree in civil or environmental engineering, or in a related field.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Possess a minimum GPA of 3.0 out of 4 on the most recent two-years of full-time study.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Have the ability to demonstrate English language proficiency through previous training or an English language exam as this is the language of instruction at the U of A\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Required Documents for University of Alberta Scholarship\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>While applying for the 2026 University of Alberta Scholarship, you will be required to submit the following documents;\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Application Form \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Academic transcripts \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Research results: Published thesis, award certificates, etc. to prove their academic achievements and research capabilities.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>A Study Plan or Research Proposal \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Two Recommendation Letters.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>CV\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>How To Apply for University of Alberta Masters Scholarship 2026\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To apply for the University of Alberta Masters Scholarship, follow the instructions we have outlined below; \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Click on the button below to visit the scholarship webpage\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Fill the \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fdocs.google.com\u002Fforms\u002Fd\u002Fe\u002F1FAIpQLSc9pocDTv9qx7w3vo_NKebMTHT8Pf9BtPMv85mRBL9cj1CPyQ\u002Fviewform\">Registration Form\u003C\u002Fa> for the research group\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Upload all the required documents and submit your application\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>You will be contacted if you are qualified for the opportunity.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>APPLY HERE: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fdocs.google.com\u002Fforms\u002Fd\u002Fe\u002F1FAIpQLSc9pocDTv9qx7w3vo_NKebMTHT8Pf9BtPMv85mRBL9cj1CPyQ\u002Fviewform\">https:\u002F\u002Fdocs.google.com\u002Fforms\u002Fd\u002Fe\u002F1FAIpQLSc9pocDTv9qx7w3vo_NKebMTHT8Pf9BtPMv85mRBL9cj1CPyQ\u002Fviewform\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>","linkskool",16,"published",0,"2026-04-16 14:44:51",null,[16],{"fileName":17,"oldFileName":17,"type":18,"file":19,"url":20},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Funiversity-of-alberta-masters-scholarship-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F69e0e7d359ede9.25086178_screenshot 2026-04-16 144005.png","image","","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Funiversity-of-alberta-masters-scholarship-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F69e0e7d359ede9.25086178_screenshot%202026-04-16%20144005.png","2026-06-24 11:55:43",[23],{"id":24,"name":25,"createdAt":26},2,"Opportunities","2026-01-07 13:35:07",3,[29,39,48,58,67,76,85,94,102],{"id":30,"slug":31,"title":32,"images":33,"datePosted":37,"authorName":38},305,"dartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity","Dartmouth College Kings Scholarship Usa 2026: Fully Funded Opportunity",[34],{"fileName":35,"oldFileName":35,"type":18,"file":19,"url":36},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fdartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c3537be16a2.95289717_screenshot 2026-06-24 204255.png","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fdartmouth-college-kings-scho